============================================================
C. Original paper, datasets, and third-party material
============================================================

The following are NOT covered by Section A or Section B and keep their
own terms:

  - The original paper: S. Yadav, S. Gupta, A. K. Yadav, and S. Gupta,
    "CSRBoost: Clustered Sampling With Resampling Boosting for
    Imbalanced Dataset Pattern Classification," IEEE Access, 2025,
    DOI 10.1109/ACCESS.2025.3616207. Its text, tables and figures are
    the copyright of its authors and the publisher. This repository
    compares numbers against that paper for the purpose of a
    reproducibility study and does not redistribute the paper.

  - The datasets in the numbered folders (01_PSDAS ... 15_FLARE-F):
    they come from the UCI Machine Learning Repository and the KEEL
    dataset repository and remain under the terms of their original
    providers and donors. They are redistributed unmodified only so
    that the scripts can be run; check the original source for the
    applicable terms before any other use.

  - The libraries the code depends on (scikit-learn, imbalanced-learn,
    PyTorch, pandas, numpy, xlrd) are not part of this repository and
    keep their own licenses.

